---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About AI Tools Hub"
  description="Learn about AI Tools Hub - your trusted source for AI tool reviews, tutorials, and comparisons."
>
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1>About AI Tools Hub</h1>
    <p>
      AI Tools Hub is your go-to resource for honest, in-depth reviews
      and tutorials about the latest AI tools. We test every tool ourselves
      and share our unbiased findings to help you make informed decisions.
    </p>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      We believe everyone deserves access to clear, honest information about
      AI tools. Our mission is to cut through the marketing hype and deliver
      real-world insights that help you choose the right tool for your needs.
    </p>
    <h2>What We Cover</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Reviews:</strong> Deep-dive evaluations of individual AI tools</li>
      <li><strong>Comparisons:</strong> Head-to-head matchups between competing tools</li>
      <li><strong>Tutorials:</strong> Step-by-step guides to get the most from AI tools</li>
      <li><strong>Best-of Lists:</strong> Curated rankings for specific use cases</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Have questions or suggestions? Reach out at
      <a href="mailto:contact@your-domain.com">contact@your-domain.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
